    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to hit The Junkyard tracks in <strong>Rust &amp; Roll</strong>, the ultimate racing game where your ride is as good as your scavenging\u00a0skills!. Drive into the chaotic world of junkyard racing, where every vehicle you find can be a diamond in the rough.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Vehicles:</strong>\u00a0Start with cars in various sates of disrepair and turn them into racing machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Scavenge parts and modify your vehicles to enhance performance and style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you transform trash into treasure and dominate the <strong>Rust &amp; Roll</strong> circuits? Buckle up and find out!</p>",
